The openeebus library provides the complete EEBus SHIP/SPINE/LPC protocol
implementation. This project contributes an ESP32 platform port (WebSocket
adapter layer) and ESPHome external component wrappers. All upstream source
files from NIBEGroup/openeebus are used unmodified via git submodule.
